        "question": "Is encryption at rest enabled for the managed relational database that stores support tickets, and if so is it provided by the cloud platform or configured by the application team?",
        "rationale": "Tickets contain customer support correspondence and are persisted in a managed relational database, but the documentation does not state whether or how they are encrypted at rest. Knowing whether encryption is enabled and who provides it affects how inherited controls are modeled and how data confidentiality is characterised.",
